      `Flying laps spend ${fullPct.toFixed(1)}% of the time at ≥90% throttle and ${coastPerLap.toFixed(2)}s per lap coasting (off both pedals above 20 mph).`,
      coastPerLap > 1 ? 'Coasting is time with no tyre work. Trail the brake into the turn-in or pick up maintenance throttle earlier.' : 'Transitions are tight. Gains will come from earlier full-throttle application on exits.',
      'MEDIUM', esc(chObj(s,'tps').name)));
